# The framework's own site's keys in Azure (F164.3) - COPY TO .env.secrets.framework AND FILL IN YOUR VALUES.
# .env.secrets.framework is git-ignored and is never committed. deploy.ps1 secrets -App louis-agent-framework-app puts
# them in the vault, under its own suffix, -framework, so they can differ from louis-agent.dev's.
#
# The model's key is one both sites share: leave it out here, and the vault keeps louis-agent.dev's.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Key for the framework site's API: required (FX18). The door lets a visitor talk to Orbi without it.
AGENT_API_KEY=
# The admin's own key. The release needs one in the vault for each app.
ADMIN_API_KEY=
